        {
          "text": "Inyuma ya Ehudi haje Shamugari mwene Anati, ari na we yishe Abafilisitiya amajana atandatu abicishije igisonga. Nuko na we yabaye umutabazi w’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
